<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.jarvis.avman-embed-probe</string>
    <!--
      2026-07-14: avman's te3 channel went 503 ("分组 *** 下模型
      text-embedding-3-large 无可用渠道（distributor）") — relay up (chat 200,
      /models still lists te3), no upstream channel behind the embedding model.
      The brain now routes te3 through GitHub Models via the litellm recipe
      (same model, same vectors: re-embedding stored chunks through GitHub and
      comparing to the avman-era vectors gave self-cosine 0.9994-1.0000 against
      a 0.3961 cross baseline).

      That is a STOPGAP with a hard deadline: GitHub Models is fully retired
      2026-07-30 (`sunset` header on every response). This probe watches for
      avman coming back so we can revert before the cliff; if it never does, a
      different te3 provider has to be in place by then either way.

      Hourly. Exit 0 = still down (one log line). Exit 10 = back, and the log
      carries the full revert recipe (including the embedding_signature UPDATE
      that keeps 21,701 chunks from reading as stale).

      No secrets (wrapper sources .env.local) → this .plist == .plist.template.

      Manual:  bash scripts/jarvis-avman-embed-probe.sh; echo $?
      Log:     /tmp/avman-embed-probe.log
      Verify:  launchctl print "gui/$(id -u)/com.jarvis.avman-embed-probe"
    -->
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/Projects/jarvis-knowledge-os-v2/scripts/jarvis-avman-embed-probe.sh</string>
    </array>
    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@17/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
        <key>HOME</key>
        <string>/Users/chenyuanquan</string>
    </dict>
    <key>StartInterval</key>
    <integer>3600</integer>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/.gbrain/avman-embed-probe.stdout.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/.gbrain/avman-embed-probe.stderr.log</string>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/chenyuanquan/Projects/jarvis-knowledge-os-v2</string>
</dict>
</plist>
